supabase/.temp/

# Recovered Art of Drink course corpus. Tier B, rights_status `authorized_private`:
# Ashley's own enrolled course, not ours to redistribute — and a private repo is
# still the wrong home for a verbatim copy of somebody's paid course. The
# database is the store of record; docs/BRIX_KNOWLEDGE.md says how to recover
# these files again.
data/knowledge/
